Error [E3203]: `Packet` is not a C-compatible type for a foreign function parameter or return.
  --> tests/ui/cffi_layout_enum_growable.jet:7:21
    |
  7 |     fn send(packet: Packet) -> I32 = "send_packet"
    |                     ^^^^^^
 Why: `@Extern` / `@Bindgen` functions must use types with a stable C ABI at the edge.
 Fix: Use scalars, `String`, or a struct with C layout; pointers only through the gated tier.
